    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Combi, on go au kwatt en taco, j'ai les dos pour la course.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["commuting"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-10T07:15:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-002",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le réseau ne passe pas, je peux même pas send le message au combi.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["internet"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-10T09:30:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-003",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Ils ont encore coupé le courant au kwatt, je wanda !",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["electricity"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-10T12:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-004",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Baisse un peu le prix des tomates, je n'ai pas assez de nkap pour buy tout ça.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["market_bargaining"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-11T08:45:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-005",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Avec cette pluie, je préfère nang à la piol au lieu de waka dehors.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["rain"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-11T16:20:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-006",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le taximan est parti fala l'essence, sa caisse est à sec.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["fuel", "commuting"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-12T06:50:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-007",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Combi, viens tchop le poisson ici, on peut discuter le prix.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["roadside_business", "market_bargaining"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-12T13:10:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-008",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le bendskin va me bring au kwatt, je ne veux pas waka jusqu'à la piol.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241386",
    "topics": ["bendskin", "commuting"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-12T17:40:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-009",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "On m'a djoss qu'il y a des vols au kwatt, garde bien ton phone.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": ["security"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-13T19:05:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-010",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Combi, arrête de djoss, on go au school, le prof nous wait déjà.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": ["university"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T07:55:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-011",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le taximan demande encore les dos, il dit que l'essence coûte trop cher.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": ["commuting", "fuel"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T08:30:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-012",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le courant est back à la piol, mais le réseau ne passe toujours pas.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": ["internet", "electricity"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-14T20:15:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-013",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Ashia !",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": [],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T07:40:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-014",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "On dit quoi ?",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": [],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T07:42:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-015",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le mbom a tum les beignets au kwatt.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241297",
    "topics": ["market_bargaining", "roadside_business"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T08:10:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-016",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Je n'ai pas le mbourou, je suis nguémé jusqu'à la fin du mois.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241393",
    "topics": ["market_bargaining"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T08:25:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-017",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "On va grap au ngola en opep, le ben-sikin est trop cher.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241393",
    "topics": ["commuting"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T09:00:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-018",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Le djo va djaffer le soya avec le aboki.",
    "manual_transcription_attested": true,
    "collector_id": "ICTU20241393",
    "topics": ["food_and_drink", "roadside_business"],
    "created_at": "2026-01-15T12:30:00Z"
  },
  {
    "statement_id": "ycf-019",
    "revision": 1,
    "source_kind": "field",
    "target_variety": "cameroon_francanglais",
    "raw_text": "Ma remé dit que le pater va bring le damé à la locale.",
